      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I just tried out your world, and it seems like these errors start popping up as soon as objects are destroyed. I recommend you create a pool of objects to reuse instead of creating and destroying them if that's what you're doing.\nThe 'lag' issue could be caused by the networking system trying to track hundreds of invalid objects, or maybe you are right that it is not related. I'd highly recommend you start by fixing the errors in your world. If you think the lag is unrelated, then you can make another world that only plays the songs and does not create the objects to see if you have the same issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
