      "value": "@{5cfeed9b106f260e86a00f06|full_name} thanks for the follow-up, but I was not able to replicate the lag your reported. See the attached pictures as a reference. Going from left to right, the first picture is in my home world, where you can see I get an average of about 90fps, with a regular short dip around 60fps. Every 10 seconds or so, I get a single-frame dip down to about 30fps when Garbage Collection happens (not pictured).\nThe second image (in the middle), shows the profiler while playing a song in your world. The average is around 70fps, with dips into 15-30fps as the song plays.\nThe third image, on the right, was captured after I played two songs in your world and returned to my homeworld. Again, I average around 90fps (maybe a little higher), with regular dips to 60fps, and the GC spike around once every 10 seconds.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
